1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,746
Mandir ke bahar baithe-baithe din nikal jaata hai, kamai kuch nahi.

2
00:00:05,046 --> 00:00:11,006
Kishan, mandir ke bahar hi to sabse bada bazaar hai! Phool-mala ki dukaan laga!

3
00:00:11,306 --> 00:00:14,342
Phool to ek din mein murjha jaate hain, Pujari ji!

4
00:00:14,642 --> 00:00:20,470
Isiliye roz subah mandi se taaze phool la. Shuruaat bas 8 hazaar mein.

5
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:25,603
Prasad, agarbatti aur nariyal bhi rakh. Ek grahak, chaar cheezein!

6
00:00:26,153 --> 00:00:29,447
Bhaiya, pooja ke liye do mala aur ek nariyal de do.

7
00:00:29,747 --> 00:00:33,631
Gende ki taaza mala, 50 rupaye. Bhagwan khush, aap khush!

8
00:00:33,931 --> 00:00:39,472
Roz ki bikri se ₹1,000 se ₹1,500 bachenge. Tyohaar pe to kai guna!

9
00:00:39,772 --> 00:00:45,629
Aur shaadi, udghatan ki sajawat ke order le. Ek order, poore hafte ki kamai.

10
00:00:45,929 --> 00:00:49,096
Phoolon jaisi mehki kismat! Kishan ki life set!
